1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,108
The Little Prince and Qiqi kept flying, still on their way home.

2
00:00:05,058 --> 00:00:08,323
This time they came to a gray planet.

3
00:00:08,323 --> 00:00:13,720
A man sat on the ground, with many many empty bottles beside him.

4
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:16,529
He was drinking from a new one.

5
00:00:16,529 --> 00:00:18,220
Hello!

6
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:20,441
What are you drinking?

7
00:00:20,441 --> 00:00:23,308
Qiqi asked curiously.

8
00:00:23,308 --> 00:00:25,558
I'm drinking wine.

9
00:00:25,558 --> 00:00:28,558
The man said with his head down.

10
00:00:28,558 --> 00:00:30,970
Why do you drink wine?

11
00:00:30,970 --> 00:00:34,352
To forget something I'm embarrassed about.

12
00:00:34,352 --> 00:00:36,838
What makes you embarrassed?

13
00:00:36,838 --> 00:00:39,647
Drinking makes me embarrassed.

14
00:00:39,647 --> 00:00:41,764
The man whispered.

15
00:00:41,764 --> 00:00:44,808
Qiqi tilted her head and thought.

16
00:00:44,808 --> 00:00:48,544
Wait... you drink to forget that you drink?

17
00:00:48,544 --> 00:00:51,397
But you're still drinking right now!

18
00:00:51,397 --> 00:00:54,955
The man took another sip and said nothing.

19
00:00:54,955 --> 00:01:01,279
Qiqi whispered to the Little Prince — He seems to be going in circles and can't get out.

20
00:01:01,279 --> 00:01:03,705
The Little Prince nodded.

21
00:01:03,705 --> 00:01:07,676
When you don't look at a problem, it only gets bigger.

22
00:01:07,676 --> 00:01:12,191
Qiqi looked at the empty bottles — more and more and more.

23
00:01:12,191 --> 00:01:17,161
If he stopped and looked at what he's afraid of, would he not need to drink?

24
00:01:17,161 --> 00:01:23,411
The Little Prince said softly — Yes, facing a problem is braver than running away.

25
00:01:23,411 --> 00:01:26,485
Qiqi held the Little Prince's hand.

26
00:01:26,485 --> 00:01:30,352
Next time I'm scared, I'll look at it first!

27
00:01:30,352 --> 00:01:32,882
They gently flew away.

28
00:01:32,882 --> 00:01:36,529
The man's bottles kept growing and growing.

29
00:01:36,529 --> 00:01:40,102
Kids, have you ever been scared of something?

30
00:01:40,102 --> 00:01:45,117
Try looking at it first — maybe it's not as scary as you think

